lege dorm community  it prominently quoted my rapist talking  about how he felt free to be himself in  this culture this article was glowingly  reposted by many people who knew  including arthur and joanna i used to  tell people I wasn't trying to get them  to pick a side his versus mine it felt  like the polite fair answer one that  allows for complexity and redemption as  if this was just a bad breakup and I'm  the one who's already moved on but it is  not that and I know what I really want  were none of my friends to talk to him  ever again or elevate his thoughts on  social media I don't want to see his  company on my colleges website I want it  to be illegal for well-meaning  progressives to post diatribes online  decrying a culture that allows Brett  Kavanaugh to prosper even as they remain  friendly and cordial with the Brett  Cavanaugh's in their own community  whenever a rapist is in the noose  whether it's mine or Ben Roethlisberger  I want rape in the headline for how long  maybe forever maybe just until I stop  feeling angry definitely at least a  little bit longer  Arthur deleted his post after I publicly  commented on his support of a rapist he  briefly apologized and then went on to  do something very similar only a couple  months later we do not talk anymore  Joanna deleted her post as well as I  told her how betrayed I felt she asked  how could she be forgiven for something  that felt unforgivable to me she would  ask again crying that night in my  apartment and again a month or two later  as she told me all the things she loved  the most about our friendship  I didn't really have an answer for her  then only that I hoped things would be  okay again  someday not everyone gets a second  chance but then again so many people  don't even ask for one they're not  willing to live with the discomfort of  knowing that they hurt someone they care  about long enough to make it right  meanwhile Laura in true Scorpio fashion  went on what she calls a rampage  s